{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien forces have invaded our galaxy, crushing Earth's defenses in a brutal campaign to seize control of the entire universe. In the aftermath, a rebel alliance known as Alpha Force Zero rises from the ashes as humanity\u2019s last hope against annihilation.\u00a0 Your ship is equipped with lasers and an auto-turret that can utilize power ups for temporary upgrades. Unlock more advanced ship equipment to give you the upper hand as you mercilessly dodge bullets and try to survive the enemy onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your ships auto-turret is able to manually be switched between laser and shotgun firing modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/8871ad0f7d95406c83cd64372ecdee9b.poster.avif?t=1772650298\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/8871ad0f7d95406c83cd64372ecdee9b.webm?t=1772650298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/8871ad0f7d95406c83cd64372ecdee9b.mp4?t=1772650298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/106c035f46b537e000dc7be2894ab956.poster.avif?t=1772650298\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/106c035f46b537e000dc7be2894ab956.webm?t=1772650298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784370/extras/106c035f46b537e000dc7be2894ab956.mp4?t=1772650298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 